<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.AFRICAN TRADE DATA MAY BE RELEASED WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>S.AFRICAN TRADE DATA MAY BE RELEASED WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African February trade data will not be released on Tuesday, but could be released on Wednesday, a South African Revenue Services official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>A Reuters consensus poll of economists forecast a 1.04 billion rand surplus in February compared with a 0.52 billion rand surplus in January.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
